__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
tmp/
.DS_Store

# Claude Code local state — per-machine, and this repository is public.
# settings.local.json is a personal permission set; worktrees are large.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# `.github/workflows/released.yml` writes the GitHub release body here, from the
# annotated tag plus a comparison footer, and feeds it to `gh release create`.
# That is a build artifact of one run and never content — the tag is the only
# home for a release's prose, and this file is a rendering of it.
#
# Ignored because a stray copy is not free. One left at this root on 2026-09-05
# was a draft `v0.1.0` annotation touching nothing, and it refused every adopter
# in a five-repository round, back when `skeletor-upgrade` asked whether the
# CHECKOUT was clean rather than whether the RENDER was reproducible. That guard
# is fixed and this entry does not depend on it: an untracked file no ref can
# name still reads as dirt to `skyrow-workspace/scripts/skeletor-currency.py`,
# which counts it separately and correctly.
notes.md

# The operator half of the upstream record: which repositories this checkout
# watches and where they are. Per-machine, and it names a PRIVATE repository
# while this one is public — see `declared_upstreams()` in bin/skeletor-maintain.
upstream.local.json
